<% content_for :title, "BonID Submission Rejected" %>

<h2 style="color: var(--danger-red); font-weight: 700;">BonID Rejected</h2>

<div class="status-card" style="border-left-color: var(--danger-red); background: #fff5f5;">
  <strong>Status:</strong> Rejected<br>
  Your submission did not meet verification requirements.
</div>

<p>Dear <strong><%= @submission.user.first_name %></strong>,</p>

<p>
  Unfortunately, your BonID verification could not be approved at this time.
  You may review the reason and resubmit your documents for verification.
</p>

<p>
  <a href="<%= citizens_identity_submissions_url %>" class="button" style="background: var(--haitian-blue);">Review Submission</a>
</p>

<p>
  If you need help understanding the rejection reason, please contact support at
  <a href="mailto:support@bonid.ht">support@bonid.ht</a>.
</p>

<p>BonID Verification Team</p>
